--[[
    BLOCK PLACER SERVER
    Version: 4.0.0
    Platform: Roblox Studio

    SERVER RESPONSIBILITIES:
    - Validate placement and deletion requests
    - Calculate grid positions
    - Perform server-side raycasts
    - Create and replicate blocks
    - Delete blocks
    - Play global sounds
    - Spawn break particles
    - Manage the block grid

    The client cannot directly create or delete blocks.
]]

